WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Initial image and configuration trajectory
Predict future images from an initial observation and a planned robot configuration trajectory.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Future robot renderings
Render the robot along the supplied joint and gripper trajectory from the observation viewpoint.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Shared world model
Doppel combines future robot renderings with the numerical action trajectory.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Future scene prediction
The video backbone predicts future frames conditioned on the initial observation and robot motion.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Franka, UR5e, and WidowX
A shared conditioning adapter and video backbone are trained across all three embodiments.
